        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>EDIT: Unless you were talking about the hero promos, they all have individual pages on BGG too. <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgamefamily/17936/sentinels-of-the-multiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Link</a> to Sentinels 'family' page, which list all the expansions and promos</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Most of the recent promos aren't on BGG. There are the sample images from the Kickstarter campaign, but there aren't card backs or even card fronts with the final wording.</p>",
