        "raw": "[quote=\"Matchstickman\"]\n\nEDIT: Unless you were talking about the hero promos, they all have individual pages on BGG too. <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgamefamily/17936/sentinels-of-the-multiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Link</a> to Sentinels &#39;family&#39; page, which list all the expansions and promos\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nMost of the recent promos aren&#39;t on BGG. There are the sample images from the Kickstarter campaign, but there aren&#39;t card backs or even card fronts with the final wording.\n",
